Better Mount HUD for Sunrise 26.3 (version 0.5.0)

A port of Better Mount HUD (1.3.1) by Lortseam, with contributions from AndreAugustoDev,
GrinlexGH, alxstack, whqwert, Riflusso and Abelpro678.
Original source: https://github.com/Lortseam/better-mount-hud
Original licence: GPL-3.0-only

Ported to Sunrise by arismoko: the HUD layouts are written in Rust on Sunrise's typed mod
API from the original's observable behaviour (no Java code is included). This port is
distributed under the same licence as the original (GPL-3.0-only); the licence text is in
LICENSE.

Assets carried from the original repository under the GPL-3.0-only licence: icon.png.
